d all over the map, and I think would be really nice to narrow down, because, as you said, Daniel so everybody knows what meditation is. Everybody knows at least one person that meditates in life and everything, but it's really unclear what exactly we are after and why. In certain cases, this is kind of like beneficial, and in other cases, basically it has negative consequences. And this is why precisely we are doing this project on depersonalization and meditation. And I can share with you informally, Scoop, but data is here, so we kind of like can share with. So what we did in this project, basically we took people with typical controls that don't have depersonalization and never meditated.", 'words': [{'text': 'Did', 'start': 2891926, 'end': 2892096, 'confidence': 0.95009, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'I', 'start': 2892118, 'end': 2892208, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'miss?', 'start': 2892214, 'end': 2892720, 'confidence': 0.72, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'Yeah.', 'start': 2892870, 'end': 2893570, 'confidence': 0.8168, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'So', 'start': 2895380, 'end': 2895984, 'confidence': 0.96346, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'obviously', 'start': 2896102, 'end': 2896432, 'confidence': 0.99994, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'I', 'start': 2896486, 'end': 2896656, 'confidence': 1.0, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': "don't", 'start': 2896678, 'end': 2896780, 'confidence': 0.99884, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'have', 'start': 2896790, 'end': 2896964, 'confidence': 0.99805, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'many', 'start': 2897002, 'end': 2897204, 'confidence': 0.9998, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'questions', 'start': 2897242, 'end': 2897540, 'confidence': 0.99996, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'because', 'start': 2897610, 'end': 2897892, 'confidence': 0.99993, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': "it's", 'start': 2897946, 'end': 2898128, 'confidence': 0.99727, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'like', 'start': 2898144, 'end': 2898372, 'confidence': 0.99983, 'speaker': 'C'}, {'text': 'we', 'st