ellness>AlternativeMedicine>HolisticHealth'}, {'relevance': 0.003758026519790292, 'label': 'FineArt'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 237488, 'end': 266190}, 'sentences_idx_start': 29, 'sentences_idx_end': 29}, {'text': "And this allows us to propose but it's of course on a working process and we are very open to feedback at any stage of this presentation that the term selfless states may be misleading because what is lost is an ordinary way to mentally model the self relation to the body and the world. So our roadmap is composed as follows first I will passing through debates and definitions of losing oneself and body.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.7021737694740295, 'label': 'Style&Fashion>BodyArt'}, {'relevance': 0.008957565762102604, 'label': 'FamilyAndRelationships>Bereavement'}, {'relevance': 0.005691446363925934, 'label': "HealthyLiving>Men'sHealth"}, {'relevance': 0.005526211112737656, 'label': 'BooksAndLiterature>ArtAndPhotographyBooks'}, {'relevance': 0.004888443276286125, 'label': 'Style&Fashion>PersonalCare>Shaving'}, {'relevance': 0.004232670646160841, 'label': 'Style&Fashion>Beauty'}, {'relevance': 0.0031900168396532536, 'label': 'Sports>Bodybuilding'}, {'relevance': 0.0029492108151316643, 'label': 'Religion&Spirituality>Spirituality'}, {'relevance': 0.0025123213417828083, 'label': 'FineArt>ModernArt'}, {'relevance': 0.002388759981840849, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>CosmeticMedicalServices'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 268500, 'end': 305660}, 'sentences_idx_start': 30, 'sentences_idx_end': 31}, {'text': 'So that means I will go through alterations in these three dimension during massive state and then I will introduce Keen concept of predictive process in the active infrastructure framework that are useful in our explanation. So that then I can unpack the role of the biological self organization and homostatic self regulation in constituting our sense of self. And then pass to our more claim that the processes like somatosensory, attenuation and transparent self modeling are a key mechanism underlying the phenomenology of deep mathematical states.', 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.06705038249492645, 'label': 'Science>Physics'}, {'relevance': 0.03390168398618698, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>ArtificialIntelligence'}, {'relevance': 0.02515406534075737, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>VirtualReality'}, {'relevance': 0.015381849370896816, 'label': 'Science'}, {'relevance': 0.014761331491172314, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>DiseasesAndConditions>BrainAndNervousSystemDisorders'}, {'relevance': 0.011708199977874756, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>ParanormalPhenomena'}, {'relevance': 0.007764608599245548, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>AugmentedReality'}, {'relevance': 0.00448370398953557, 'label': 'Religion&Spirituality>Spirituality'}, {'relevance': 0.0030931367073208094, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Robotics'}, {'relevance': 0.001334599801339209, 'label': 'MedicalHealth>DiseasesAndConditions>SleepDisorders'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 305730, 'end': 354148}, 'sentences_idx_start': 32, 'sentences_idx_end': 34}, {'text': "And this then will allow us to draw our conclusions and present ongoing related projects. So let's come back to the sense of self. So when one has to investigate the sense of self, of course, as I said it's so wide concept that so many definitions and characterization of the sense of self has come up in philosophy and cognitive science. So we have terms like minimal self experience, selfhood sense of ownership and all of this.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.46639612317085266, 'label': 'Religion&Spirituality>Spirituality'}, {'relevance': 0.07024382799863815, 'label': 'Religion&Spirituality'}, {'relevance': 0.065291628241539, 'label': 'Religion&Spirituality>Agnosticism'}, {'relevance': 0.012427190318703651, 'label': 'BooksAndLiterature>Biographies'}, {'relevance': 0.006643941160291433, 'label': 'Style&Fashion>BodyArt'}, {'relevance': 0.005623918026685715, 'label': 'Style&Fashion>Beauty'}, {'relevance': 0.0056098951026797295, 'label': 