 3101190}, 'sentences_idx_start': 286, 'sentences_idx_end': 293}, {'text': "We just finished data collection on intentional binding and depersonization. So related to the sense of agency. That's all for me for now. We're kind of like in between because Valerie represented very well, like the theory part and the studies are literally just getting hot from the oven now. And we hope that in September it's like we're going to get them out. Yeah, but the data is in the box, so that's very exciting and yeah, we have the results.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.10898009687662125, 'label': 'Style&Fashion>BodyArt'}, {'relevance': 0.05497683957219124, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>ContentProduction'}, {'relevance': 0.016675857827067375, 'label': 'FineArt>Design'}, {'relevance': 0.016090761870145798, 'label': 'FineArt>DigitalArts'}, {'relevance': 0.012925942428410053, 'label': 'BooksAndLiterature>ArtAndPhotographyBooks'}, {'relevance': 0.009768601506948471, 'label': 'Technology&Computing>Computing>Internet>SocialNetworking'}, {'relevance': 0.00768910301849246, 'label': 'PopCulture'}, {'relevance': 0.006189991254359484, 'label': 'Style&Fashion>Beauty'}, {'relevance': 0.0050547863356769085, 'label': 'Hobbies&Interests>ArtsAndCrafts>DrawingAndSketching'}, {'relevance': 0.004701586440205574, 'label': 'Education>OnlineEducation'}], 'timestamp': {'start': 3101720, 'end': 3135920}, 'sentences_idx_start': 294, 'sentences_idx_end': 299}, {'text': "Thank you, Danielle, again for this platform. It's really nice. And as I said, I really hope that after this discussion, we'll have more opportunities to change, exchange and discuss. We also plan to organize something around alteration of self consciousness across various conditions and also decarbonization in Lisbon next year. So maybe you can cross the pond and check for yourself that we have a nice airport in Lisbon. Yeah, cool. Well, good to get the appetizer before the entree.", 'labels': [{'relevance': 0.759741485118866, 'label': 'BusinessA